Rules: analyse the existing workspace first. Do not change, delete, rename or restructure it. Build on top of it only. Keep it clean, no redundant files/folders. Inspect the app only with the tools/browser workflow available in this workspace. Treat the existing user stories in the workspace as the source of truth.

AUT:
- Library Card (US-01 to US-12): https://webapps.tekstac.com/SeleniumApp2/Library/LibraryCard.html
