STEP 2 - Create Application Analysis & Requirements.txt: application overview, navigation flow, module analysis, US-01 to US-28, acceptance criteria for every story (existing stories + actual behaviour), element IDs, field types, observed behaviour, validation rules, success/error messages, discrepancies. Use it as context for later test-case and code generation. Also document any extra rules found during inspection.
Validation rules:
