- Services (Ask a Librarian): Medium radio (Email/Call/Chat) must be picked first. Call: phone details only, NO submit, NO validation. Email: From non-empty (no email-format check), Query non-empty. Chat: Name non-empty, Your Phone non-empty (no digit check), Query non-empty.
