STEP 6 - defect_report.json: exactly one consolidated file with at least 8 validation defects across all 3 modules, from actual test execution only (no AI prediction or assumptions). Each: Defect ID, Module, User Story ID, Test Case ID, Test Data, Steps, Expected Result, Actual Result, Severity, Priority, Status, execution details.

FINAL: the workspace must contain a complete, executable, maintainable solution: Application Analysis & Requirements.txt, testcases.csv, Playwright TypeScript POM codebase (30+ tests, meaningful assertions), defect_report.json.